From bb50257f38ace6151de1daee82d97de769257deb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 15:20:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dp: Drop dev_pm_opp_set_rate(0)
X-Original-Commit: 331d7eefa2aa3f708869eb25bc9c73231be48a4f
X-Original-Committer: map220v <map220v300@gmail.com>
X-Original-Committer-Date: 2026-08-17T03:58:54Z

dev_pm_opp_set_rate(0) removes the vote specified in required-opps but
does not actually park the clock, making it run without the necessary
power backing. Drop the explicit calls to it.

Fixes: c943b4948b58 ("drm/msm/dp: add displayPort driver support")
Signed-off-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: map220v <map220v300@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c
index 9024abdc2c569f4dac7c67f8eb2e291ae778847a..e09924eae5a7a827a620ee367ca3e474737ab536 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.c
@@ -2571,7 +2571,6 @@ void msm_dp_ctrl_off_link_stream(struct msm_dp_ctrl *msm_dp_ctrl)
 		ctrl->stream_clks_on = false;
 	}
 
-	dev_pm_opp_set_rate(ctrl->dev, 0);
 	msm_dp_ctrl_link_clk_disable(&ctrl->msm_dp_ctrl);
 
 	phy_power_off(phy);
